title: 竞技场咏唱运行时API

本条目描述技能源码内部可使用的咏唱运行时 TypeScript API 草案。

玩家通过编程智能体编写发展规则和行动规则。行动规则可以直接调用角色身上可用的技能；每个技能拥有 id、描述、源码位置、参数约束和可用条件。技能源码内部包含咏唱代码，咏唱代码通过咏唱过程接口生成签名链，并通过咏唱结束接口提交给游戏运行时。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface SkillDefinition<TParams> {
  id: string;
  description: string;
  sourceRef: SourceRef;
  canUse(actor: ActorRef, params: TParams, world: WorldSnapshot): boolean;
  execute(params: TParams, context: SkillExecutionContext): Promise<SkillExecutionResult>;
}

export interface SkillExecutionContext {
  actor: ActorRef;
  world: WorldSnapshot;
  chant: ChantProcessRuntime;
  finish: ChantFinishRuntime;
}

export interface ChantContainer {
  provide<T>(token: Token<T>, factory: (ctx: ChantProcessRuntime) => T): void;
  get<T>(token: Token<T>): T;
}

export interface ChantProcessRuntime {
  codex: ChantCodex;
  clock: ChantClock;
  repository: ChantRepository;
  logger: ChantLogger;
  rules: ChantRuleSet;
  equipment: EquippedArtifact[];
  events: ChantEventRuntime;
  recipe: ChantRecipeRuntime;
}

export interface ChantFinishRuntime {
  submit(input: ChantFinishInput): Promise<GameEffectReceipt>;
}

export interface ChantFinishInput {
  skillId: string;
  paramsHash: string;
  signatures: ChantSignature[];
  branchId?: string;
}
```

!! 咏唱过程接口文档

平台长期稳定提供以下过程接口族：

```ts
export interface ChantCodex {
  archive: ArchiveApi;
  hexstone: HexstoneApi;
  prayer: PrayerApi;
  index: IndexApi;
  lattice: LatticeApi;
  artifact: ArtifactApi;
  seal: SealApi;
  areaPower: AreaPowerApi;
}
```

每族 API 返回 opaque 中间对象，不能伪造：

```ts
type PageFragment = Opaque<'PageFragment'>;
type FacetShard = Opaque<'FacetShard'>;
type MeterKey = Opaque<'MeterKey'>;
type BoundVerse = Opaque<'BoundVerse'>;
type ChantProof = Opaque<'ChantProof'>;
```

!! 技能源码中的咏唱代码

```ts
export class BlinkStrikeSkill implements SkillDefinition<BlinkStrikeParams> {
  id = 'blinkStrike';
  description = '短距离跃迁后进行一次突击';
  sourceRef = SourceRef.fromModule('skills/blinkStrike.ts');

  canUse(actor: ActorRef, params: BlinkStrikeParams, world: WorldSnapshot): boolean {
    return world.distance(actor, params.target) <= params.maxRange;
  }

  async execute(
    params: BlinkStrikeParams,
    context: SkillExecutionContext,
  ): Promise<SkillExecutionResult> {
    const strategy = new DistanceRouteStrategy(context.chant.rules);
    const source = new ArchiveVerseAdapter(context.chant.codex.archive);
    const collector = new MeterPulseCollector(context.chant.clock);
    const pipeline = new ChantPipelineFactory(
      context.chant.codex,
      context.chant.rules,
    ).create('mobility');

    collector.subscribe();

    const route = strategy.choose(params);
    const fragment = await source.nextVerse(route.seed);
    const pulse = await collector.waitFor(route.requiredPulseFamily);
    const bound = await pipeline.run({ fragment, pulse, params });

    const receipt = await context.finish.submit({
      skillId: this.id,
      paramsHash: hashParams(params),
      branchId: route.id,
      signatures: context.chant.codex.seal.collect({
        route,
        eventKeys: [pulse],
        pipelineTrace: bound.trace,
      }),
    });

    return {
      skillId: this.id,
      receipt,
    };
  }
}
```

同一个技能源码可以根据参数或环境分支多次调用咏唱结束接口：

```ts
if (params.needEscape) {
  await context.finish.submit({
    skillId: this.id,
    paramsHash: hashParams(params),
    branchId: 'escape',
    signatures: escapeSignatures,
  });
}

if (params.needImpact) {
  await context.finish.submit({
    skillId: this.id,
    paramsHash: hashParams(params),
    branchId: 'impact',
    signatures: impactSignatures,
  });
}
```

!! 行动规则调用技能

```ts
export class CombatActionRule implements ActionRule {
  tick(actor: ActorRef, world: WorldSnapshot): ActionRuleResult {
    if (world.enemyInRange(actor, 12)) {
      return actor.skills.call('blinkStrike', {
        target: world.nearestEnemy(actor),
        maxRange: 12,
      });
    }

    return actor.actions.holdPosition();
  }
}
```

行动规则负责决定何时调用技能。技能源码负责执行咏唱代码并提交签名链。游戏运行时负责根据签名链匹配游戏效果。

!! 与旧 API 的区别

| 旧机制 | 新机制 |
| `combatRuntime.createIntent()` | 行动规则直接调用技能 id |
| `combatRuntime.cast(result)` | 技能源码调用咏唱结束接口提交签名链 |
| `CombatResult` 手动构造 | 游戏效果由运行时根据签名链匹配生成 |
| 旧式独立咏唱程序 | 玩家通过编程智能体维护发展规则、行动规则和技能源码 |
| 技能效果由咏唱代码决定 | 咏唱代码只生成签名链，效果由游戏运行时匹配 |
| 能量池直接扣除 | 能量来源通过咏唱过程接口调用自然消耗 |

